					"nextDialogs": [
						4540602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷澤"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540602,
					"content": "哼，罷了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻瑞亞斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540603,
					"content": "就像之前，這小子說的。外來的狼群破壞了這裡的規矩。牠們必然會被制裁。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻瑞亞斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540604,
					"content": "但是你——雷澤，你不准參與討伐。因為這是狼的問題。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻瑞亞斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540605,
					"content": "你使用鋼鐵而不是爪牙，駕馭雷電而不是利齒…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻瑞亞斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540606,
					"content": "你屬於人類。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻瑞亞斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540607,
					"content": "我和他們，不一樣！我才不屬於他們！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷澤"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540608,
					"content": "你…不是狼。這是狼之間的事情。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻瑞亞斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540609,
					"content": "#倒是{F#妳}{M#你}，雷澤在人類中的盧皮卡。{F#妳}{M#你}倒是高尚又特殊之人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻瑞亞斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540610,
					"content": "如果有心，可以向我來尋求試煉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻瑞亞斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540611,
					"content": "我言盡於此，有緣再見吧，雷澤，和陌生的人類…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻瑞亞斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540612,
					"content": "唔…雷澤，別露出那種表情嘛。對了！要不要去城內住幾天？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安柏"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540613,
					"content": "對啊，你在蒙德城也有一個朋友，不是嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540614,
					"content": "那個「紅色的、很燙的，女孩子」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540615,
					"content": "現在野外的行人對你也很危險。我知道你不想傷害他們。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安柏"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540616,
					"content": "#我沒事，{F#妳}{M#你}們，放心。但我不屬於城市…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540617
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷澤"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540617,
					"content": "我，也不屬於這裡…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540618,
						4540619
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷澤"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540618,
					"content": "雷澤…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540621
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 4540621,
					"content": "#謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}們。{NICKNAME}，派蒙，還有……另一個紅色的女孩。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540622
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷澤"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540622,
					"content": "我陪你聊了那麼久，你居然不記得我叫安柏——？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540623
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安柏"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540623,
					"content": "那麼，再見了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "雷澤"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540619,
					"content": "不要太消沉了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540621
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
